English history.

192
00:08:48,462 --> 00:08:49,530
SYLVIA: Absolutely.

193
00:08:49,897 --> 00:08:54,802
Our motto here at Puggsley is,
uh, <i>Puer paratus, puer felix.</i>

194
00:08:54,902 --> 00:08:57,238
"A prepared child..."
"...is a successful child."

195
00:08:57,338 --> 00:08:59,240
